debark-gui (@VERSION@) @DISTRIBUTION@; urgency=medium

  * Debark packaged as a .deb for the first time.
  * Ships one binary, one desktop entry, one icon theme set, one AppStream
    component and the licence. No maintainer scripts of any kind: the
    desktop-file and icon-cache updates are dpkg triggers owned by
    desktop-file-utils and hicolor-icon-theme, so nothing in this package
    runs as root at install time.
  * Depends are derived from the built binary with dpkg-shlibdeps, never
    hand-written. The package therefore declares the GTK 3 and WebKitGTK 4.1
    runtimes it actually links.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  @DATE@
